# Authentication & authorization

- Access token short-lived; refresh token long-lived with **rotation** (revoke old RT on refresh)
- Verify JWT fully (signature + expiry + critical claims like `iss`, `aud` when configured)
- Prefer HttpOnly cookies for web sessions; do not store tokens in `localStorage`
- Multi-tenant (if applicable): resolve tenant from subdomain / JWT claim / `X-Tenant-Id` and set tenant context in middleware
- Authorization is not just role: enforce **resource ownership**; use guards/policy-based checks (CASL or equivalent)

